WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:07,360
Yoyo, there are a lot of bacteria in people's mouths, and chewing is unhygienic.

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:10,700
I'll spray some alcohol on it and chew it again.

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:18,050
Yoyo, what this little mute probably means is that these are not delicious enough and he wants to make something more delicious for you.

4
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:32,444
Not delicious yoyo

5
00:00:32,444 --> 00:00:43,960
I like them all

6
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:46,960
This is the first time I have seen Wu Wei with such obvious emotional ups and downs.

7
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,982
you say

8
00:00:47,982 --> 00:00:52,070
I can follow your appearance

9
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:53,602
carve a statue

10
00:00:53,602 --> 00:00:57,690
Do I burn incense for you every day?

11
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:03,090
I will go to Miaoho Temple tomorrow to ask.

12
00:01:03,090 --> 00:01:10,910
Do you still know about coming back?

13
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:11,567
Hum

14
00:01:11,567 --> 00:01:20,760
I thought you didn't know the way home?

15
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:27,070
I knew that if others didn’t pick out the rest, they wouldn’t give it to me. They were giving it to me alone.

16
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:29,460
Or does everyone have a share?

17
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:32,780
Brother, are you angry?

18
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:39,490
It's because I feel uncomfortable, and I care about it so much.
